<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, I open to Your working today;</l><l>Saturate each part, Lord without reservation.</l><l>Lord, I offer You my full coop’ration;</l><l>Lord, that You alone possess my whole heart today.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, I do thank You for dying for me;</l><l>Lord, Your precious blood has redeemed me from all dross;</l><l>Lord, you bore my sins on that old rugged cross.</l><l>Lord, You sacrificed Your whole life fully for me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, I’ve been constrained by God’s love through You.</l><l>Master, how can I ever turn away from You?</l><l>Lord, I do love You; I give myself to You.</l><l>Lord, I consecrate my whole life fully to You.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
